{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "D8.4.1v2/D3.4.6: invocation-local shared storage descriptors admit native numeric regions; type changes, negative zero and subnormals preserve JS semantics. D8.4.1v2: the proven Map shape now guards nominal ownership directly; shared lookup and complete semantic misses are retained.",
